<%- include('partials/header') %>

<style>
  body {
    background: linear-gradient(125deg, #050403 0%, #100A07 38%, #28140C 72%, #422315 100%) !important;
    min-height: 100vh;
  }
  .main-content-gradient, .page-hero-banner {
    background: transparent !important;
    border: none !important;
    box-shadow: none !important;
  }
  
  /* Transparent Cards with Golden Border */
  .main-content-gradient > .container > div,
  .main-content-gradient .grid-2 > div,
  .stat-counter-card {
    background: transparent !important;
    border: 1px solid rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.4) !important;
    box-shadow: none !important;
  }

  /* Text Colors to compliment dark background */
  .main-content-gradient p,
  .main-content-gradient p span,
  .stat-label-text span {
    color: #F4EDE0 !important;
  }
  
  .main-content-gradient h2,
  .main-content-gradient h2 span,
  .main-content-gradient h3,
  .main-content-gradient h3 span,
  .stat-num-value {
    color: #CBA135; text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(203, 161, 53, 0.4); !important;
    text-shadow: 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.5) !important;
  }
  
  .main-content-gradient h2 {
    border-left-color: #CBA135; text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(203, 161, 53, 0.4); !important;
  }
  
  .page-hero-banner h1 span,
  .page-hero-banner p span {
    color: #F4EDE0 !important;
  }
</style>

<section class="page-hero-banner">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="section-badge">
      <span class="lang-mr">इतिहास व भव्य परंपरा</span>
      <span class="lang-en">History & Grand Tradition</span>
    </span>
    <h1>
      <span class="lang-mr">आमच्याबद्दल - मलबार हिलचा राजा</span>
      <span class="lang-en">About Us - Malabar Hill Cha Raja</span>
    </h1>
    <p>
      <span class="lang-mr">श्री बाल गोपाल गणेशोत्सव मंडळ (स्थापना १९७३)</span>
      <span class="lang-en">Shree Bal Gopal Ganeshotsav Mandal (Est. 1973)</span>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="main-content-gradient" style="padding: 5rem 0;">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px;">
    
    <style>
      .history-card {
        background: var(--bg-dark);
        border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
        border: 1px solid var(--border-gold);
        padding: clamp(1.5rem, 5vw, 3rem);
        box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
        margin-bottom: 3rem;
      }
      .history-title {
        font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 4vw, 2rem);
        color: var(--temple-maroon);
        margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
        border-left: 4px solid var(--royal-gold);
        padding-left: clamp(0.5rem, 2vw, 1rem);
        white-space: nowrap;
        overflow: hidden;
        text-overflow: ellipsis;
      }
      @media (max-width: 480px) {
        .history-title {
          font-size: clamp(0.95rem, 4.5vw, 1.2rem);
        }
      }
    </style>
    <div class="history-card">
      <h2 class="history-title" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--royal-gold), #fff); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;">
        <span class="lang-mr">मंडळाचा गौरवशाली इतिहास</span>
        <span class="lang-en">Glorious History of the Mandal</span>
      </h2>
      <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.9; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; text-align: justify;">
        <span class="lang-mr">भायखळा येथील ७१४, दगडी चाळ, बापूराव जगताप मार्ग, भायखळा (पश्चिम), मुंबई - ४०००११ वरील ऐतिहासिक श्री बाल गोपाल गणेशोत्सव मंडळ परिसरात १९७३ साली मंडळाची स्थापना झाली. सुरुवातीपासूनच स्थानिक रहिवासी, तरुण कार्यकर्ते आणि ज्येष्ठ मार्गदर्शकांनी मिळून सार्वजनिक गणेशोत्सवाची भव्य परंपरा सुरू केली.</span>
        <span class="lang-en">Established in 1973, the historic Dagdi Chawli Chi Aai Mauli Navratri Mandal in Byculla, Mumbai, is renowned for its deep-rooted devotion, grand Navratri celebrations, and the divine presence of Aai Mauli.</span>
      </p>
      <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.9; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; text-align: justify;">
        <span class="lang-mr">वर्षानुवर्षे 'मलबार हिलचा राजा' ही मूर्ती हजारो आणि लाखो भाविकांच्या गळ्यातील ताईत बनली. मूर्तीची प्रसन्न राजेशाही मुद्रा, भव्य काष्ठ सिंहासन आणि अनोखा मण्डप शृंगार हे राजाचे वैशिष्ट्य मानले जाते.</span>
        <span class="lang-en">Under the association of Hon. Shree Arun Gawli Ji and Hon. Ma’am Asha Arun Gawli Ji, the mandal has become a cherished symbol of faith, tradition, and community unity, attracting devotees from across Mumbai and beyond to seek the blessings of the Goddess and celebrate this sacred legacy.</span>
      </p>
    </div>


    <!-- Animated Stat Counter Row -->
    <div class="grid-2" style="margin-bottom: 3rem; gap: 1.5rem;">
      <div class="stat-counter-card">
        <div class="stat-num-value" data-target="1973" data-no-comma="true">1973</div>
        <div class="stat-label-text">
          <span class="lang-mr">स्थापना वर्ष</span><span class="lang-en">Founding Year</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-counter-card">
        <div class="stat-num-value" data-target="53">53</div>
        <div class="stat-label-text">
          <span class="lang-mr">अविरत सेवेची वर्षे</span><span class="lang-en">Years of Continuous Service</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>



  </div>
</section>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
